WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:06,580
This is Senior Sister Ji’s natal spiritual pet, huh?

2
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:08,220
This is my natal spirit animal

3
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:10,620
Four flaming bird red clouds

4
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:11,900
Although small in size

5
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:14,100
But it’s not right to have strong fighting ability

6
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:15,420
Don't even think about changing the subject

7
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:22,700
You must explain things clearly to me, Junior Brother Chu

8
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:25,260
You are too unlucky, right, senior sister?

9
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:26,500
Please be gentle

10
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:28,780
sorry sorry but

11
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:30,180
She has only been here less than two days

12
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:32,060
Being promoted to second level is a monster.

13
00:00:32,970 --> 00:00:34,690
It took me half a year

14
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,040
Just now when I faced the fake Akao

15
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:38,240
There is no drama on the face

16
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:40,470
What if I didn't come?

17
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:44,070
She will also find a way to deal with Akashio, right? Junior Brother

18
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:45,630
Now that things have happened

19
00:00:45,630 --> 00:00:47,430
Why don't you take a look at that fat worm you contracted?

20
00:00:47,430 --> 00:00:48,790
What kind of spirit beast is it?

21
00:00:48,790 --> 00:00:57,780
Maybe it’s not bad

22
00:00:57,780 --> 00:00:59,920
It's quite cute.

23
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:01,280
But I don’t think I’ve seen it before
